<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8 sm:py-16">
  <%!-- Hero --%>
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight">Shindex</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-base-content/70">
      A personal inventory system for people with too many things
      and not enough memory.
    </p>
  </div>

  <%!-- What it does --%>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-12">
    <div class="rounded-box bg-base-200 p-6">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-4">What Shindex does</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <.icon name="hero-check-circle" class="w-5 h-5 text-success shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
          <span>
            <strong>Track items with photos and locations.</strong>
            Snap a photo, type a shelf code, done. Sub-30-second workflow.
          </span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <.icon name="hero-check-circle" class="w-5 h-5 text-success shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
          <span>
            <strong>Find things fast.</strong>
            Text search, filters, and AI-powered semantic search
            ("things that cut metal").
          </span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <.icon name="hero-check-circle" class="w-5 h-5 text-success shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
          <span>
            <strong>Organize by location.</strong>
            Shelf &rarr; Bin hierarchy. Know exactly where everything is.
          </span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <.icon name="hero-check-circle" class="w-5 h-5 text-success shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
          <span>
            <strong>Share inventories.</strong>
            Give read-only access to friends or coworkers so they can
            find and borrow your stuff.
          </span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-box bg-base-200 p-6">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-4">What Shindex doesn't do</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <.icon name="hero-x-circle" class="w-5 h-5 text-base-content/40 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
          <span>
            <strong>No payments or financial data.</strong>
            We don't process payments, store credit cards, or track
            anything monetary.
          </span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <.icon name="hero-x-circle" class="w-5 h-5 text-base-content/40 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
          <span>
            <strong>No messaging.</strong> There's no chat or DMs. Coordinate with people however
            you already do.
          </span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <.icon name="hero-x-circle" class="w-5 h-5 text-base-content/40 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
          <span>
            <strong>No personal data beyond your name.</strong>
            We store your name and LinkedIn profile photo.
            That's it. No phone numbers, no addresses.
          </span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-2">
          <.icon name="hero-x-circle" class="w-5 h-5 text-base-content/40 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
          <span>
            <strong>No data selling.</strong> Your inventory is yours. We don't monetize, analyze,
            or share your data with anyone.
          </span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%!-- Privacy note --%>
  <div class="rounded-box border border-base-300 p-6 mb-12">
    <h2 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Privacy</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
      Your inventories are private by default. Other users cannot see your
      items unless you explicitly share access. Shindex is
      <a
        href="https://github.com/greghgradwell/shindex"
        target="_blank"
        class="link link-primary"
      >
        open source
      </a>
      &mdash; you can read every line of code that handles your data.
      This is an early beta hosted on a single server. The developer has
      database access for maintenance and debugging, as with any hosted
      service. Don't store sensitive personal information &mdash; this is
      an inventory tool, not a vault.
    </p>
  </div>

  <%!-- Guest access --%>
  <div class="rounded-box border border-base-300 p-6 mb-12">
    <h2 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Have a view-only code?</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 mb-4">
      Enter the code to browse an inventory without signing in.
    </p>
    <form phx-submit="submit_guest_code" class="flex gap-2">
      <input
        type="text"
        name="code"
        value={@guest_code}
        phx-change="update_guest_code"
        phx-debounce="100"
        placeholder="Enter code"
        class="input input-bordered flex-1"
      />
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-neutral" disabled={@guest_code == ""}>
        View Inventory
      </button>
    </form>
    <%= if @guest_error do %>
      <p class="text-error text-sm mt-2">{@guest_error}</p>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <%!-- Sign in --%>
  <div class="text-center">
    <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60 mb-4">
      Beta access is by invite only. Have a code? Sign in to get started.
    </p>
    <a href={~p"/auth/linkedin"} class="btn btn-neutral">
      <svg class="size-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
        <path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z" />
      </svg>
      Sign in with LinkedIn
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
